Date: Wed, 19 Sep 2018 00:28:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] ath9k: Switch to mac80211 TXQ scheduling and airtime APIs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This moves the ath9k driver to use the mac80211 TXQ scheduling and
airtime accounting APIs, removing the corresponding state tracking
inside the driver.

