From 9c14e82c0873bde6815b616d00d1e0d48b824508 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rajkumar Manoharan <rmanohar@codeaurora.org>
Date: Wed, 12 Sep 2018 14:23:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ath10k: reporting estimated tx airtime for fairness

Transmit airtime will be estimated from last tx rate used.
Firmware report tx rate by peer stats. Airtime is computed
on tx path and the same will be reported to mac80211 upon
tx completion.

Signed-off-by: Kan Yan <kyan@google.com>
Signed-off-by: Rajkumar Manoharan <rmanohar@codeaurora.org>
---
